    <!-- Window-background-only theme: Compose owns everything else. The values-night variant
         swaps the parent so the pre-Compose window background matches the device's light/dark
         setting instead of always flashing light (there is no framework DayNight theme; that
         is an AppCompat feature this project doesn't depend on). -->
